{
  "name": "Receive WhatsApp messages in n8n with the Cosend Trigger",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive WhatsApp messages in n8n with the Cosend Trigger\n\n### How it works\nEvery WhatsApp text message a customer sends to your business number starts this workflow. The Cosend Trigger fires on Message Received (message.received, Message Types: Text) and each item carries the sender's name and phone. While no person has taken over the chat, a Switch node routes by keyword: price and hours get a reply with Message › Send, and anything else goes to Conversation › Set Control (Passed to a Person), so your team answers in the Cosend inbox.\n\n### Setup\nSelf-hosted n8n with the n8n-nodes-cosend community node (version tested 2026.11.1; install guide at cosend.app/docs/n8n). A Cosend account on any plan, including Free, with a connection API key in the Cosend API credential. Activate: the trigger registers its own signed webhook with Cosend. Send a test message to your number.\n\n### Customization\nEdit the keywords and replies, add more Message Types, append each message to Google Sheets, or save media to Drive.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a01",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pick the reply by keyword\nEach rule checks the message text in any letter case. Add a rule for each keyword and name its output. **Anything else** catches every other message.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a02",
      "name": "Pick the reply by keyword",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reply or pass to your team\nEach reply goes into the same conversation, inside WhatsApp's 24-hour window, so any text works. **Pass to my team** puts the conversation in your Cosend inbox for a person.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a03",
      "name": "Reply or pass to your team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "message.received"
        ],
        "filters": {
          "messageTypes": [
            "text"
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a04",
      "name": "When a WhatsApp message arrives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosendTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5b01",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.content.body }}",
                    "rightValue": "price",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "contains"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Prices"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5b02",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.content.body }}",
                    "rightValue": "hours",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "contains"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Opening hours"
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "Anything else",
          "ignoreCase": true
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a05",
      "name": "Route by keyword",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "conversation",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "Thanks for asking! Our prices start at 25 EUR. Reply with the service you want and we will send you the details.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a06",
      "name": "Reply with prices",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "conversation",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "We are open Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00, and Saturday, 10:00 to 14:00. See you soon!",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a07",
      "name": "Reply with opening hours",
